# Supabase Realtime Presence Configuration
# 100% Free Tier: 200 concurrent real-time WebSockets, 2,000,000 messages/month, $0 cost.
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to Project Settings -> API Keys
# 3. Copy the Project URL and modern Publishable Key (sb_publishable_...):
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your-key-here

# Note: Legacy VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is also supported for backwards compatibility.
